schema: concept-lineage
object:
  title: Crypto donation platform selection checklist
  type: concept-lineage
  short_description: >-
    The article's five-factor evaluation framework for choosing among crypto
    donation platforms — fees, supported cryptocurrencies, instant
    stablecoin conversion, integration with existing donor-management
    systems, and setup support.
  toolkit_usage: >-
    Given directly in crypto-donation-platforms.md as "What to Look For"
    ahead of the getting-started steps (create account, verify 501(c)(3)
    status, customize page, publish, promote).
  adjacent_meanings:
    - vendor-selection-checklist (a generic org-tooling pattern this specializes for crypto)
  important_distinctions:
    - "these are user-facing selection criteria, not the compliance/KYC criteria covered in the sibling compliance-legal.md article"
  tensions:
    - low-fees vs full-feature-set-and-support
  risks_of_flattening: >-
    Presenting five bullet factors as sufficient understates real diligence
    needs (e.g. platform security history, insurance/custody model) not
    mentioned in the source article.
  maturity: raw
  ai_assisted: true
  provenance:
    origin: src/content/docs/crypto-donation-platforms.md
    transformation: summarized
    authorship: ai-assisted
  work_order: wo-620c0c65c46f
  source_lineage: crypto-donation-platforms.md
